<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability (Mammalian cerebral cortex & subcortical white matter (Homo sapiens, Pan troglodytes, Macaca mulatta, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus))",
        "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability faithfully reproduces Mammalian cerebral cortex & subcortical white matter (Homo sapiens, Pan troglodytes, Macaca mulatta, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mammalian cerebral cortex & subcortical white matter (Homo sapiens, Pan troglodytes, Macaca mulatta, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-cortical-gyrification-folding-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Mammalian cerebral cortex & subcortical white matter (Homo sapiens, Pan troglodytes, Macaca mulatta, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus)" ;
