<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Code-to-model traceability: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation to Richman et al. (1975) Eq. 1 & Table 1, Tallinen et al. (2014) Eq. 1-3 & Fig. 1-4, Tallinen et al. (2016) Fig. 2-4, Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015), Zilles et al. (1988), and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean` (L1-53, L130-163)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
