    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Tallinen et al.'s (2014) multiplicative growth excess Delta_g = max(0, g - g_c), Richman et al.'s (1975) cube-root sulcal wavelength scaling lambda = 2*pi*h*(mu_c/(3*mu_s))^(1/3), Zilles et al.'s (1988) Gyrification Index GI = P_pial / P_hull (L130-158), and an L-BFGS-B energy minimizer of a growing 2D coronal neo-Hookean cortical shell + subcortical white-matter foundation (`relax_neohookean_cortical_shell`, L164-327) with zero-growth (g=1.00), lissencephaly (h=6.50 mm, g=1.14), and polymicrogyria (h=0.85 mm) controls (L449-484), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L666-749) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with statistical tests and uncertainty: 11-species sulcal wavelength Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 1.6e-29, RMSE = 0.008 mm), 11-species GI Pearson r = 0.9985 (p = 1.1e-11, RMSE = 0.044), log-log wavelength-thickness exponent alpha = 0.9993 ± 0.0005 (ref 1.0), Human GW38 relaxed shell wavelength 11.1997 mm (ref 11.34 mm) and GI 2.5597 (ref 2.56), zero-growth ablation GI 1.0000 (ref 1.0), polymicrogyria vs normogyria sulcus ratio 3.0357 (ref 3.0357), coronal specimen GI 2.8115 (ref 2.56, CV = 0.3243), and 11-species lambda/h = 4.3642 (ref 4.3565)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-11-species-mammalian-gyrification-index-scaling-correlation-tallinen-2014-mota-2015>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-11-species-mammalian-sulcal-wavelength-scaling-correlation-richman-1975-tallinen-2014>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-coronal-human-brain-specimen-segmented-gyrification-index-gi-specimen-cerebral-cortex-gyri-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-cross-species-log-log-power-law-exponent-alpha-lambda-h-alpha>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-human-gw38-l-bfgs-b-relaxed-neo-hookean-shell-gyrification-index-gi-sim>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-human-gw38-l-bfgs-b-relaxed-neo-hookean-shell-sulcal-wavelength-lambda-sim>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-polymicrogyria-vs-normogyria-sulcus-frequency-modulation-ratio-richman-et-al-1975>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-universal-dimensionless-sulcal-wavelength-to-thickness-invariant-lambda-h-across-11-mammals>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-measurement-zero-growth-lissencephaly-negative-control-gyrification-index-g-g-c-vs-gw38>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — MorphoEval overall 93.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 93.1/100, up from 56.2/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 2D coronal neo-Hookean multiplicative-growth (F = F_e G) cortical shell bonded to a soft subcortical white-matter core via L-BFGS-B energy minimization; reproduces the 11-species mammalian sulcal wavelength and Gyrification Index collapse across Rodentia, Carnivora, Artiodactyla, Cetacea, and Primates (r = 1.0000 for wavelength, r = 0.9985 for GI, log-log exponent alpha = 0.9993 ± 0.0005); validates Richman et al.'s (1975) polymicrogyria (h = 0.85 mm -> 85 sulci), lissencephaly (h = 6.50 mm, g < g_c -> 0 sulci, GI = 1.0000), and zero-growth (g = 1.00) controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked coronal human cerebral cortex specimen image (`cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg`, 52 sulcal troughs, GI = 2.8115, CV = 0.3243). Overall 93.0/100 (faithfulness 92.6, reproducibility 93.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_gyrification_folding_comparison.png: rendered output of 1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 821237 B, 2104×1452 px, artifact_sha256 b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519 (sha256 b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519), spec_fingerprint 90353ad40be0c49263b8cded1ab4fed2933fe58ce57cedb91cc5cc5a4ac29ad0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 90353ad40be0c49263b8cded1ab4fed2933fe58ce57cedb91cc5cc5a4ac29ad0; artifact_sha256: b39586ccf22a61152ce3e5d36ae5410c69d36efd3669d69ad5675ae5dd5a0519; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cerebral_cortex_gyri_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/cortical_gyrification_folding_reference.json=94947373ac49d97d..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/paper_citations.bib=56bc1d0beedebe37..., datasets/cortical_gyrification_folding/scout_manifest.json=7f5410ff8ad2c1ee...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-cortical-gyrification-folding-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D coronal neo-Hookean shell solver to a full 3D tetrahedral fetal brain mesh generated from gestational MRI templates (Tallinen et al. 2016 Nature Physics) to resolve 3D Y-shaped sulcal junctions and regional cortical thickness gradients." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Parameter expressivity: 92/100" ;
