<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014, 2016) neo-Hookean constrained cortical expansion and sulcal creasing instability — Morphological realism / specimen match: 91/100" ;
